    "blocks": [
      {
        "heading": "Order birthday flower delivery online",
        "headingLevel": "h2",
        "bodyHtml": "<p>Birthday bouquets can be merchandised from the shared product catalog with consistent names, product IDs, pricing, images, variants, delivery messaging, and PDP details. The same products can appear in birthday PLPs, homepage birthday rails, landing pages, and related product modules without duplicating product data.</p>"
