      {
        "heading": "Send birthday flowers or plants anytime",
        "headingLevel": "h4",
        "bodyHtml": "<p>For last-minute gifts, the product data carries same-day messaging that can be displayed on PLP cards and PDP availability panels while leaving final delivery checks to checkout or availability services.</p>"
